('a1-u03-l03-q04','a1-u03-l03','multiple_choice','Complete: They have got ___ hair.','[{"id":"a","text":"short"},{"id":"b","text":"shorts"},{"id":"c","text":"shortly"}]','a','Use the adjective short before hair.',4);
